      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enter zone 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hill Giant \n\u0022Wotan will not tolerate your presence on our lands, heretic scum! He will guide us to victory over your forces...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Drunken Dwarves",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Guard Thurin \n\u0022Har! Why do they send Gymner here? We will miss the Troll hunting in Gunthera...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf \n\u0022Bah.. Who knows? We are supposed to guard Gymner for some ceremony. Others always have the fun...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Guard Thurin \n\u0022Just pass me the ale... We might as well have a good time while we guard this damn gate!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist \n\u0022We overheard the drunken dwarves, Master. They guard the passage which leads to the gate!!!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin Warning 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist \n\u0022The region is infested with goblins, Master! We are not certain what vile creatures could accompany these pests... We must be cautious, in any case.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Win Quest 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duke \n\u0022We have accomplished our task Master. The Loremaster Gymner is dead...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Cloudkeeper \n\u0022I.. I am defeated. My... Mo.. Morok will avenge my death. You w.. will feel the wrath of the clans!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Demonologist \n\u0022Look! The gate is opening! Bethrezen will finally be free of his infernal prison! Our Master returns to us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Demonologist \n\u0022Wha... What is this?!! A boy? Where is the great demon which commanded infernal armies! Where is Bethrezen if he is not imprisoned here? Has our leader that we have waited for so long... forsaken us?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Help",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sorcerer \n\u0022Master, the Undead Hordes have used their sorcery on Gymner... Are they trying to help us free Bethrezen? What is their purpose?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Cloudkeeper \r\u0022Your attempts to stop me are futile! The Clans will not be thwarted, your accursed god will be imprisoned forevermore...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sorcerer \n\u0022Gymner is starting the ceremony... We must strike now, time is of the essence!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100UN0030",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T1 Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf\n\u0022What?! Demons - here?! Leave these lands before we crush you! These are Mountain Clan territories, leave now while you still can...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist\n\u0022Master, shall we kill the dwarf messenger before he warns others of our presence? He must be stopped!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf Messenger",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor\n\u0022The dwarf messenger has arrived at his destination, Master... I fear the Clans are now aware of our presence!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Win Quest 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bethrezen \n\u0022Do you not recognize me? Bow before the ruler of Hell...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Destroy Guard 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor \n\u0022We have caught and destroyed a guard... The gate must not be far! We must be on the alert for enemies; We will most likely meet more resistance the closer we get to the gate.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf move",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf Guard \n\u0022Begone beasts! Evil creatures such as you are not allowed beyond this point! Leave or perish...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf messenger killed",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor \n\u0022We have killed the messenger, Master! If we can get rid of the High King\u0027s son before he seals the infernal gate, Bethrezen will be freed!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Free Giants",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lose Quest T85",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Cloudkeeper \n\u0022Ha ha ha! The ceremony has been  accomplished! Now the gate will stand sealed for a century!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner  T40",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist \n\u0022Here! A message from Gymner has arrived!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf Messenger \n\u0022Leave these lands, filthy beasts! You will never succeed in stopping Gymner\u0027s ceremony. Bethrezen\u0027s fate is already sealed...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor \n\u0022The dim-witted Dwarves seem unaware of our presence, Master. We should take advantage of the situation...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner T70",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gymner Cloudkeeper \n\u0022All is lost for you, demons. The gate is almost sealed... I will take care of you after the ceremony is accomplished!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S100SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S100EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist \n\u0022Hurry master! If Gymner succeeds we are doomed...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
